# Timeout Rollback

Khi reservation timeout/cancel phai tra lai **dung so luong da reserve**.

\\	ext
Sai:  INCRBY stock 1
Dung: INCRBY stock {reservedQuantity}
\
- Neu reserve 5 san pham thi phai tra lai 5.
- Rollback phai **idempotent** (xem idempotency.mdc) de tranh tra stock nhieu lan.
- Dung Redis marker rollback:{orderId}:{itemId} set khi rollback lan dau, cac lan sau skip.

## Lua script

File src/main/resources/lua/rollback_stock.lua thuc hien:
- Check marker idempotency.
- INCRBY flash_sale:stock:{itemId} dung reservedQuantity.
- DECRBY flash_sale:user_limit:{slotId}:{userId}:{itemId} dung reservedQuantity.
- SET marker rollback:{orderId}:{itemId} voi TTL 1 ngay.

## Redis -> Database Compensation

Redis decrement thanh cong nhung DB order creation that bai co the gay inconsistency.

### Flow fail

\\	ext
Redis reserve
 \-- DB fail (constraint / timeout / deadlock)
 \-- Compensate Redis (rollback_stock.lua)
 \-- Restore exact reserved quantity
\
### Quy tac

- **Khong trien khai Saga hoac 2PC** cho scope hien tai.
- Try-Catch compensation **phai tranh double compensation** (dung marker idempotency).
- Ca 2 phia (Redis + DB) deu phai co marker rieng:
  - Redis: rollback:{orderId}:{itemId} (TTL 1 ngay).
  - DB: cot order.status transition hop le (PENDING_PAYMENT -> CANCELLED_TIMEOUT chi 1 lan).
